---
/**
 * AEGIS Governance Federation Network — Landing Page
 */
---

<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
<head>
  <script src="/shared/aegis-nav.js" defer></script>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>AEGIS Governance Federation Network</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Decentralized governance intelligence sharing via the AT Protocol. The AEGIS Governance Federation Network enables federated organizations to share governance signals across an open, interoperable network." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="nav-brand">
        <span class="nav-logo">AEGIS</span>
        <span class="nav-subtitle">Governance Federation</span>
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#how-it-works">How It Works</a>
        <a href="#signals">Signals</a>
        <a href="#registration">Registration</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/aegis-initiative/aegis-federation" class="nav-cta">GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-badge">Built on AT Protocol</div>
      <h1>Governance Federation<br />Network</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">
        Decentralized governance intelligence sharing for the AEGIS ecosystem.
        Publish and subscribe to governance signals — compliance attestations, policy updates,
        incident notifications, and risk advisories — across an open, federated network.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-primary">Learn More</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/aegis-initiative/aegis-federation" class="btn btn-secondary">View Source</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section id="what-is-gfn" class="section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2>What is the GFN?</h2>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div>
          <p>
            The <strong>AEGIS Governance Federation Network</strong> is a decentralized system
            for sharing governance intelligence signals across the AEGIS ecosystem. Unlike
            centralized governance reporting, the GFN leverages the AT Protocol's federated
            architecture so no single entity controls the flow of governance information.
          </p>
          <p>
            Each participant operates their own Personal Data Server (PDS) and publishes
            governance records using standardized <strong>Lexicon schemas</strong>. Records
            propagate through the AT Protocol relay network and are curated by feed generators
            into actionable intelligence streams.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-cards">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-icon">&#9878;</div>
            <h3>Federated</h3>
            <p>No central authority. Each participant controls their own data through their PDS.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-icon">&#9881;</div>
            <h3>Interoperable</h3>
            <p>Built on AT Protocol with standardized Lexicon schemas for governance records.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-icon">&#128274;</div>
            <h3>Verifiable</h3>
            <p>Cryptographic DIDs ensure signal authenticity and participant identity.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="how-it-works" class="section section-alt">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">1</div>
          <h3>Publish</h3>
          <p>
            An AEGIS-governed entity publishes a governance record to their PDS using
            the standardized Lexicon schemas. Records include signals, attestations,
            capability declarations, incidents, and policy updates.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">2</div>
          <h3>Relay</h3>
          <p>
            The AT Protocol relay network propagates the record across the federation.
            All records are cryptographically signed by the publishing DID, ensuring
            tamper-proof provenance.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">3</div>
          <h3>Filter</h3>
          <p>
            The AEGIS feed generator subscribes to the firehose and curates governance
            signals by type and severity into focused intelligence feeds.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">4</div>
          <h3>Consume</h3>
          <p>
            Federation participants subscribe to curated feeds or query the firehose
            directly. Governance signals drive automated compliance monitoring and
            incident response.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="signals" class="section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2>Governance Signals</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        The GFN defines five core record types via AT Protocol Lexicon schemas, covering the
        full spectrum of governance intelligence.
      </p>
      <div class="signal-grid">
        <div class="signal-card">
          <div class="signal-header">
            <span class="signal-badge signal-critical">Signal</span>
            <code>com.aegisfederation.governance.signal</code>
          </div>
          <p>
            Real-time governance intelligence — circumvention attempts, risk alerts,
            policy violations, anomalies, and advisories with severity classification.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="signal-card">
          <div class="signal-header">
            <span class="signal-badge signal-info">Attestation</span>
            <code>com.aegisfederation.governance.attestation</code>
          </div>
          <p>
            Cryptographically signed compliance attestations verifying that an entity
            meets a specific governance capability set.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="signal-card">
          <div class="signal-header">
            <span class="signal-badge signal-medium">Capability</span>
            <code>com.aegisfederation.governance.capability</code>
          </div>
          <p>
            Declared capability sets defining permissions, constraints, and risk
            classifications for AI systems under AEGIS governance.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="signal-card">
          <div class="signal-header">
            <span class="signal-badge signal-high">Incident</span>
            <code>com.aegisfederation.governance.incident</code>
          </div>
          <p>
            Governance incident notifications with timeline tracking, affected system
            enumeration, and status progression.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="signal-card">
          <div class="signal-header">
            <span class="signal-badge signal-low">Policy</span>
            <code>com.aegisfederation.governance.policy</code>
          </div>
          <p>
            Policy lifecycle events — new policies, amendments, and deprecations with
            effective dates and affected capability mappings.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="registration" class="section section-alt">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2>Registration Model</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Federation membership follows a trust-based tiered model. All participants
        are identified by Decentralized Identifiers (DIDs).
      </p>
      <div class="tiers">
        <div class="tier">
          <div class="tier-header tier-1">
            <h3>Tier 1 — Core Federation</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-body">
            <p>
              AEGIS-operated PDS instances with full signal publishing rights.
              These are the authoritative sources of governance intelligence.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Full read/write access to all record types</li>
              <li>Signal authorship is cryptographically verified</li>
              <li>Operated by AEGIS core infrastructure</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tier">
          <div class="tier-header tier-2">
            <h3>Tier 2 — Verified Participants</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-body">
            <p>
              Organizations that have completed AEGIS governance attestation
              and operate their own PDS.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Publish attestations and capability declarations</li>
              <li>Receive governance signals and policy updates</li>
              <li>Participate in incident response coordination</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tier">
          <div class="tier-header tier-3">
            <h3>Tier 3 — Observers</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-body">
            <p>
              Read-only access to governance feeds via the feed generator.
              No PDS required.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Subscribe to curated governance feeds</li>
              <li>Monitor governance signals and incidents</li>
              <li>No publishing rights</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="get-involved" class="section">
    <div class="section-inner section-center">
      <h2>Get Involved</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        The AEGIS Governance Federation Network is in active development. We are building
        the foundation for decentralized AI governance infrastructure.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-grid">
        <a href="https://github.com/aegis-initiative/aegis-federation" class="cta-card">
          <h3>Source Code</h3>
          <p>Browse the repository, review Lexicon schemas, and explore the feed generator implementation.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/aegis-initiative/aegis" class="cta-card">
          <h3>Governance Hub</h3>
          <p>Read the governance doctrine, architecture decisions, and specifications that define AEGIS.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="https://aegissystems.app" class="cta-card">
          <h3>AEGIS Platform</h3>
          <p>Learn about the full AEGIS ecosystem and the AI governance platform.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <p>&copy; 2026 <a href="https://aegis-initiative.com">AEGIS Initiative</a> &middot; Finnoybu IP LLC &middot; <a href="https://aegis-initiative.com/about/">About</a> &middot; <a href="https://aegis-initiative.com/contact/">Contact</a> &middot; <a href="https://aegis-initiative.com/legal/">Legal</a></p>
      <p class="footer-sub">AEGIS Governance Federation Network — Built on AT Protocol</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --color-bg: #0a0a0f;
    --color-bg-alt: #0f0f18;
    --color-surface: #161624;
    --color-border: #1e1e32;
    --color-text: #e4e4ef;
    --color-text-muted: #8888a0;
    --color-primary: #6366f1;
    --color-primary-hover: #818cf8;
    --color-accent: #22d3ee;
    --color-critical: #ef4444;
    --color-high: #f97316;
    --color-medium: #eab308;
    --color-low: #22c55e;
    --color-info: #6366f1;
    --font-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;
    --max-width: 1200px;
  }

  * {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.7;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  /* Navigation */
  .nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: var(--aegis-nav-height, 0px);
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .nav-inner {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .nav-brand {
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .nav-logo {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .nav-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .nav-cta {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .nav-cta:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-primary) !important;
    color: var(--color-primary) !important;
  }

  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    padding: calc(10rem + var(--aegis-nav-height, 0px)) 2rem 6rem;
    text-align: center;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.375rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-primary-hover);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-text) 0%, var(--color-text-muted) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .hero-lead {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: white;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary-hover);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  /* Sections */
  .section {
    padding: 5rem 2rem;
  }

  .section-alt {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
  }

  .section-inner {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-lead {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .section-center .section-lead {
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* Grid layouts */
  .grid-2 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .grid-2 p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* Feature cards */
  .feature-cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .card h3 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .card p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Steps */
  .steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .step {
    position: relative;
  }

  .step-number {
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
    color: var(--color-primary-hover);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
  }

  .step h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .step p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Signal cards */
  .signal-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .signal-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .signal-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .signal-badge {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.625rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .signal-critical { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15); color: var(--color-critical); }
  .signal-high { background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15); color: var(--color-high); }
  .signal-medium { background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.15); color: var(--color-medium); }
  .signal-low { background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.15); color: var(--color-low); }
  .signal-info { background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15); color: var(--color-info); }

  .signal-header code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .signal-card p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Tiers */
  .tiers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .tier {
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .tier-header {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .tier-header h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .tier-1 { background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1); border-bottom-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2); }
  .tier-2 { background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.08); border-bottom-color: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.2); }
  .tier-3 { background: rgba(136, 136, 160, 0.08); border-bottom-color: rgba(136, 136, 160, 0.2); }

  .tier-body {
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .tier-body p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .tier-body ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .tier-body li {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    padding: 0.375rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .tier-body li::before {
    content: '\2022';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  /* CTA cards */
  .cta-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .cta-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .cta-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .cta-card p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Footer */
  .footer {
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .footer p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .footer a {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .footer a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .footer-sub {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem !important;
    color: rgba(136, 136, 160, 0.5) !important;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
    .grid-2, .steps, .tiers, .cta-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .signal-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta) { display: none; }
  }
</style>
